        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**No cache-hit metric exists for ALS in the current build.** Unlike Quoting Service (`moja_database_get_cache_value_count`) and Central-Ledger (`moja_model_participant_count{queryName=~\".*Cached\"}`), ALS emits no cache-hit/miss counter \u2014 confirmed absent by checking the live metric set. This is an instrumentation gap, not a missing query."
